  "notes": "Two-storey cream house (#e0d6bd) with orange terracotta hip roof (#bf5a33) and rooftop solar panels. Front facade has chunky timber-framed windows and shutters (#8a6a3f) and a brown timber lattice/pergola screen at the upper floor over a front terrace. Frontage is a decorative low wall of white panels embossed with diamond and fleur-de-lis motifs, an ornate grey wrought-iron fence with diamond pattern, and a green panelled pedestrian door beside an ornate metal vehicle gate; brick-paved forecourt. Env: several big round green oaks fill the front yard, rounded green bushes hug the fence line, a grey rectangular planter pot with a bush sits near the gate, a large white municipal recycling cabinet (bin, Hebrew text) stands at the left kerb, and a dark car is parked at the right kerb. Sampled colours 2026-07-04."
